<speak>That's fine. You can take the general navigation questions at a separate time, when the screen is in front of you and you aren't balancing another conversation. If you contact support, mentioning your preference for a slower explanation should help them set the pace. For now, there is nothing further you need to read aloud from the computer. Thank you for making a private space for the appointment and for letting me know when you needed a moment with your notes.</speak>